      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "The coefficient is triangulated through two representations: a global explicit-formula route using primes and zeros, and a local analytic route using Laurent/Taylor data. Agreement offers structural cross-checking without making either representation intrinsically primary.",
